          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    \n    <h1>\n      Top 5 Cutest Dogs\n    </h1>\n    \n    <h2>1. Huskies</h2>\n    <img src=\"husky.jpg\">\n    <p>Huskies have soft fur and wolf-life features that make them adorable</p>\n    \n    <hr />\n    \n    <h2>2. Dalmatian</h2>\n    <img src=\"dalmatian.jpg\">\n    <p>Dalmatians have black and white spots which create cool patterns</p>\n\n    <hr />\n    \n    <h2>3. Bulldog</h2>\n    <img src=\"bulldog.jpg\">\n    <p>Bulldogs have pinched noses which some people don't like but I think looks adorable</p>\n\n    <hr />\n    \n    <h2>4. Corgi</h2>\n    <img src=\"corgi.png\">\n    <p>Their bodies are like little sausages and their paws are tiny and cute</p>\n\n    <hr />\n    \n    <h2>5. King Charles</h2>\n    <img src=\"kingcharles.jpg\">\n    <p>This one is a little odd, but their ears are really floppy and soft and make their eyes look so big!</p>\n\n    <hr />\n    \n    <p class=\"disclaimer\">All images from Pixabay and provided under a Pixabay license</p\n    \n  </body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
